[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/66040501","html_url":"https://github.com/rails/rails/issues/17965#issuecomment-66040501","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/17965","id":66040501,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY2MDQwNTAx","user":{"login":"mfazekas","id":52435,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52435?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas","html_url":"https://github.com/mfazekas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-12-08T09:07:19Z","updated_at":"2014-12-08T09:07:19Z","body":"The issues seems to be that previously calling a method on an `ActionMailer::Base` executed the method. Now it returns a `Delegate` and method will be executed lazily or even in another process. This is in parts seems to be documented on [ActionMailer::MessageDelivery](http://edgeapi.rubyonrails.org/classes/ActionMailer/MessageDelivery.html). \n\nPossible fixes:\n- Add a note about this potential issue to [release notes](http://edgeguides.rubyonrails.org/4_2_release_notes.html#action-mailer)\n- Add a ruby finalizer with a warning, which could be disabled when **getobj** is called.\n\nAlso for me reading the docs i understood that message delivery is async in rails 4.2. But looking the code, message generation is also async.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/66040501/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"mfazekas","id":52435,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDM1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52435?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas","html_url":"https://github.com/mfazekas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mfazekas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/comments/66041668","html_url":"https://github.com/rails/rails/issues/17965#issuecomment-66041668","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rails/rails/issues/17965","id":66041668,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDY2MDQxNjY4","user":{"login":"seuros","id":2394703,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzOTQ3MDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2394703?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seuros","html_url":"https://github.com/seuros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seuros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seuros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seuros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.githu